WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.550
Step 1. Open the Files tab. Here you archive a file of a patient or an encounter.

1.2
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:12.105
Care has no way to delete a file, and you cannot undo an archive.

2.1
00:00:12.105 --> 00:00:14.867
Step 2. Open the More Actions menu.

2.2
00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:19.603
Select the button with three vertical dots in the row of the file.

2.3
00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:24.697
If you can change files here, the menu shows Rename and Archive.

3.1
00:00:24.697 --> 00:00:29.543
Step 3. Select Archive. Care opens the Archive File dialog.

3.2
00:00:29.543 --> 00:00:32.816
It warns that this action is irreversible,

3.3
00:00:32.816 --> 00:00:37.367
and once a file is archived it cannot be unarchived.

4.1
00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:43.076
Step 4. Enter the reason. Type the reason to archive the file in the box.

4.2
00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:47.539
The reason is required, and it cannot be only spaces.

5.1
00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:51.093
Step 5. Archive the file. Select Proceed.

5.2
00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:57.235
To close the dialog without archiving the file, select Cancel instead.
